# Backend reads telemetry of all routers and sends each router its desired settings
user nethera-backend
topic read nethera/+/#
topic write nethera/+/config/#

# One block per router: publish into its own namespace only.
# Read on status is needed for the long-lived Last Will connection.
# A router may not write config/, so it cannot change its own settings.
user router-1
topic write nethera/1/status
topic write nethera/1/telemetry/#
topic read nethera/1/status
topic read nethera/1/config/#
